comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T22:48:17.505Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status search for PR 983 review hardening, CodeRabbit, retry shell quoting, durable cache, and changelog classifier found no canonical item for this exact-head finding set. The six closed feature items remain completed implementation owners; this distinct item owns post-PR review remediation and delivery evidence."
  "2026-08-11T22:48:26.214Z","harness:codex","Review inventory: CodeRabbit posted 18 findings across PM chronology, changelog classification, documentation quoting, verified collection-target recovery, annotation input sources and shell quoting, alias conflicts, validate/health row parity, assurance validation clarity, durable graph-cache composition, catalog usage classification, and focused regression strength. Thread-aware GraphQL inventory was used because flat comments omit resolution state. PM history will remain append-only; generated changelog output will only change through pm-changelog."
  "2026-08-11T23:24:53.147Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: after refreshing the acknowledged public SDK surface for required ValidateCheck.ok, 486 test files and 7,241 tests pass under node scripts/run-tests.mjs coverage. Exact V8 totals are statements 52,338/52,338, branches 38,488/38,488, functions 10,769/10,769, and lines 50,576/50,576: 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts. Focused review regression suite also passes 152/152 tests."
  "2026-08-12T01:05:40.422Z","harness:codex","Companion package evidence: pm-changelog PR #138 merged at 55c4201; protected release metadata merged at 9d272d4; Daily Release run 31552058852 passed every build, release-check, protected-PR, exact-merge, provenance publish, tag, bun-install, and GitHub-release step. npm latest and tag v2026.8.12 both resolve to the released artifact. pm-cli now activates pm-changelog 2026.8.12 and regenerated CHANGELOG.md through pnpm changelog:pm."
  "2026-08-12T01:40:24.738Z","harness:codex","Exact-head local acceptance evidence: full coverage passed 486 files and 7,242 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; pnpm lint, typecheck, contracts:check, changelog:pm:check with pm-changelog 2026.8.12, security scan, production dependency audit, package artifact validation, package-first dogfood, and packed npx smoke passed. A fresh unrelated temp root installed the tarball with npm and Bun; npx created and mutated a parent/child/dependency/evidence graph, bunx read the same state and closed/released the child, and both reported 2026.8.11. Semantic dogfood was explicitly skipped because PM_DOGFOOD_SEMANTIC was unset and is not counted as acceptance."
